{"unit_id": "tag:02ZV:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n若<MATH_0001>纤维化于群胚（groupoids），且由<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）<MATH_0002>可表（representable），则有\n<MATHSEG_0001>-同构（2-isomorphism）<MATHSEG_0002>\n参见《范畴（Categories）》，引理<REF_0001>。\n更确切地，任意<MATH_0004>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>都产生一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>。\n反之，给定<MATH_0008>上的层（sheaves）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，存在一个<MATH_0009>-态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0010>，它产生<MATH_0011>，且在唯一<MATH_0012>-同构（isomorphism）的意义下唯一。\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "2-isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚", "context": "此处的范畴纤维化于群胚。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "范畴的表示对象。"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表", "context": "此处由代数空间表示。"}, {"source_term": "2-isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "受保护数字2与可译后缀组成二同构。"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所引用的范畴章节。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴或层之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "作为表示对象的代数空间对应的层。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "受保护数字限定的唯一同构。"}], "notes": []}
